44,"text":"Is your dog sleeping?"},{"start":980.44,"end":983.639,"text":"Don't say ist dein Hund schlafend"},{"start":983.639,"end":986.44,"text":"Even though you have this in form but not continuous"},{"start":986.44,"end":988.959,"text":"Form. The correct way would be schläft"},{"start":988.959,"end":990.279,"text":"Dein Hund"},{"start":990.279,"end":993.319,"text":"Gerade again you can add this gerade to emphasize"},{"start":993.319,"end":996.959,"text":"Happening right now. And this is the perfect sentence."},{"start":996.959,"end":999.72,"text":"And as mentioned if you want to dive deeper into"},{"start":999.72,"end":1001.519,"text":"Adjective declination"},{"start":1001.519,"end":1004.959,"text":"Term declion of adjectives. Here we have a whole playlist"},{"start":1004.959,"end":1008.6,"text":"Where you can learn about each case of adjectivation"},{"start":1008.6,"end":1013.36,"text":"Or the entire system behind this nightmare."},{"start":1013.36,"end":1016.519,"text":"I hope you learn something. I hope you like this video. I hope hier"},{"start":1016.519,"end":1018.579,"text":"Bis zum nächsten Mal."}],"auto":true}